Day 56 - Troubleshooting Assessment
Issue
Website unavailable.

Investigation
Checked Apache service status
Verified Security Group rules
Evidence
Apache was running
Port 80 was missing
Root Cause
Missing HTTP (Port 80) rule in the Security Group.

Resolution
Restored the HTTP inbound rule.

Verification
Verified website accessibility using curl and a web browser.

Key Takeaway
Always collect evidence before drawing conclusions.
